# Purpose
Defines the public-safe HTML-comment marker that binds help text to closed Konui guidance targets and optional multi-bubble groups.
# Gotchas
- Markers are context hints, never executable selectors or authorization.
- Targets must come from the documented closed vocabulary.
- Automatic targets must use documented bounded `control:<key>` values; raw selectors remain forbidden.
- Copy remains plain text and at most 180 characters.
- Group order is one-based and unique within a group.
